    {
      "id": "u_ffe3e94b6b46c5f138ff8558_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Case sensitive__TRILIUM_PH_1__ – the search will distinguish upper case characters from lower case (e.g. searching for Hello will not match __TRILIUM_PH_2__).",
