    },
    {
      "id": "u_010780fba87dd9ed07202f8c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In a __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ note, the search also finds the text of the notes included with __TRILIUM_PH_2__Include Note__TRILIUM_PH_3__, in the order they appear in the note.",
      "sourceHash": "010780fba87dd9ed07202f8cd6ae7c54c5e20efa04b65c62df55c0b933247897",
      "context": "Search in note > Included notes",
      "contextHash": "72ba5cd1b791e90f9fd37d8f10e88c64d46ddf253aeef1851ad22e0bab9b19d9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_37dbfebfe67013cef2236957_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The text of included text and code notes, of embedded code files, such as a __TRILIUM_PH_0__ or __TRILIUM_PH_1__ attachment, and of drawing canvases is searched. The title of an include and the content of other notes, such as a collection or an included __TRILIUM_PH_2__Canvas__TRILIUM_PH_3__ note, are not.",
      "sourceHash": "37dbfebfe67013cef2236957a39945c6ea8efc61c1c843557d698f58d054f9a1",
      "context": "Search in note > Included notes",
      "contextHash": "72ba5cd1b791e90f9fd37d8f10e88c64d46ddf253aeef1851ad22e0bab9b19d9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_df91e67b244bdbb20e3d51c2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A result in a drawing canvas is highlighted on the drawing. The canvas moves only to show a result outside its view, and moves back once the search moves on, unless it was moved in the meantime. In a note being edited, closing the search on such a result leaves the canvas there and, while the canvas is editable, selects the text of the result.",
      "sourceHash": "df91e67b244bdbb20e3d51c20f8f02cfab25404615f85dd584aefd0b8fdf74ed",
      "context": "Search in note > Included notes",
      "contextHash": "72ba5cd1b791e90f9fd37d8f10e88c64d46ddf253aeef1851ad22e0bab9b19d9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f92d556c75660a3313a86388_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The up and down arrows move through the results of an include as through the rest of the note.",
      "sourceHash": "f92d556c75660a3313a863884361c9511f6d11da1ed9885d7555e1a4b09b6397",
      "context": "Search in note > Included notes",
      "contextHash": "72ba5cd1b791e90f9fd37d8f10e88c64d46ddf253aeef1851ad22e0bab9b19d9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a245c39154a2c27768f98436_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A result in a collapsed __TRILIUM_PH_0__Expandable__TRILIUM_PH_1__ include expands the include while that result is the current one, and collapses it again once the search moves on.",
      "sourceHash": "a245c39154a2c27768f98436576829d1e45e6a6df2a3934b1375366d90b34bb3",
      "context": "Search in note > Included notes",
      "contextHash": "72ba5cd1b791e90f9fd37d8f10e88c64d46ddf253aeef1851ad22e0bab9b19d9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_445766e4687a410937d2c3ac_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Replace__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and __TRILIUM_PH_2__Replace all__TRILIUM_PH_3__ change an included note only while its __TRILIUM_PH_4__Editable__TRILIUM_PH_5__ button is on. While the current result is in an include that cannot be edited, __TRILIUM_PH_6__Replace__TRILIUM_PH_7__ is disabled, and __TRILIUM_PH_8__Replace all__TRILIUM_PH_9__ leaves such results unchanged. The text of a drawing canvas is never replaced.",
      "sourceHash": "445766e4687a410937d2c3ac48c891d20b65c6eee95dd2b8b6da4f172a3c6ee3",
      "context": "Search in note > Included notes",
      "contextHash": "72ba5cd1b791e90f9fd37d8f10e88c64d46ddf253aeef1851ad22e0bab9b19d9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
